BT 1 0 0 1 0 90.5 Tm /F4 11.5 Tf 17 TL 2.155333 Tw (Three simple optimisations keep the application responsive. First, the billing script fetches the) Tj T* 0 Tw .9415 Tw (holiday records of the whole stay once, using a date-range criterion, instead of querying once for) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.846231 Tw (every night. Second, the holiday function checks for an existing record before inserting, which) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.968308 Tw (keeps Holiday_List small and free of duplicates. Third, reports such as Today\222s Check-ins use) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.749567 Tw (criteria so that only the relevant records are loaded, instead of the whole Booking form. These) Tj T* 0 Tw (improvements are structural; no timing figures were measured for this prototype.) Tj T* ET
