BT 1 0 0 1 0 90.5 Tm /F4 11.5 Tf 17 TL 1.595824 Tw (Hotel data such as guest identity details and billing amounts must not be lost. A backup of the) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.514429 Tw (application data should therefore be taken regularly, and at least once before each publish to) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.618656 Tw (Production, using the backup or export option available to the account owner. If a publish or a) Tj T* 0 Tw .814769 Tw (script change damages the application, the previous version can be restored from Version History) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.899067 Tw (and the data can be re-imported from the latest backup. The Holiday_List form can always be) Tj T* 0 Tw (rebuilt by running the holiday function again.) Tj T* ET
