BT 1 0 0 1 0 90.5 Tm /F4 11.5 Tf 17 TL .375708 Tw (After deployment the administrator is responsible for keeping the application accurate. Room rates) Tj T* 0 Tw .6218 Tw (and the GST percentage should be reviewed whenever the hotel changes its tariff, and the holiday) Tj T* 0 Tw .053289 Tw (function should be run once at the start of every year so that the pricing rule has current dates. Logs) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.089941 Tw (should be checked regularly for script errors, and any change to a form field name must be followed) Tj T* 0 Tw .018095 Tw (by a check of the Deluge scripts that refer to it. New staff are added by assigning them to one of the) Tj T* 0 Tw (existing permission profiles, which avoids creating separate rules for each user.) Tj T* ET
